Viewgif 1.1
-----------

Installing Viewgif 1.1
----------------------

Only one file is needed to run Viewgif and that is Viewgif.opa
Copy this file into the \APP directory and Install this using the INSTALL 
APPLICATION option.
That's it. Now you're ready to go.


Notes
-----

1) When in scroll mode , Gif file decoding is paused and only recommences when 
   scroll mode is exited.

2) The Delete Pic file option was added so as to free disk space. It deletes 
   the Gif file once decoding has finished and then tries to save it in .PIC 
   format.
   (Only use this if the GIF file and the output directory are both on the
     same storage device , and then only if it is of type RAM)

3) GIF and 'Graphics Interchange Format' are trademarks of Compuserve, Inc an
   H&R block company.



